      "domain": "pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov",
      "rank": 3
    },
    {
      "title": "CDC MMWR: Estimated influenza vaccine effectiveness for preventing hospitalization among adults aged 65 years and older, United States, 2023\u201324 season",
