      "snippet": "CDC reported that seasonal influenza vaccination reduced the risk of influenza-associated hospitalization by 39% among adults aged 65 years and older during the 2023\u201324 season. The MMWR analysis used data from FluSurv-NET sites and included patients hospitalized from November 2023 through April 2024.",
