      "url": "https://aclanthology.org/D17-1181/",
      "snippet": "Ashish Vaswani, Noam Shazeer, Niki Parmar, Jakob Uszkoreit, Llion Jones, Aidan N. Gomez, \u0141ukasz Kaiser, and Illia Polosukhin introduced the Transformer at NeurIPS 2017. The paper describes self-attention, multi-head attention, and reports state-of-the-art BLEU scores on WMT 2014 English-to-German and English-to-French translation tasks.",
      "domain": "aclanthology.org",
      "rank": 1
    },
    {
      "title": "Self-Attention with Relative Position Representations",
      "url": "https://aclanthology.org/N18-2074/",
